  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The advertisement, by reason of design, scale, size and prominent location within a residential terrace, would appear as an overdominant and incongruous addition that would result in harm to the character and appearance of the host property, the terrace it forms part of and the Wandsworth Common Conservation Area.  It is considered that there would be an unacceptable impact on visual amenity. The proposal therefore fails to accord with  policies LP1, LP3 and LP9 of the Wandsworth Local Plan (2023), and the NPPF (2024).",
    "Reason : 2 - In dealing with this application the Council has implemented the requirement in the National Planning Policy Framework to make available detailed advice in the form of our statutory policies in the Local Plan as well as offering a full pre application advice service. However, we have been unable to seek solutions to problems as the principle of the proposal is clearly contrary to our statutory policies and negotiation could not overcome the reasons for refusal."
  ],
